!Name: p06292
!C p6292 glider gun using an intermitting glider gun (IMG) and a LWSS
!C making module whose LWSS are interfering with the IMG's glider
!C stream. The original IMG's period is 3564 generations, it is
!C lengthened by the interfering of the LWSSs with the IMG's glider
!C stream by a factor of 143/81. The IMG is a normal gun which emits 1
!C glider per period.
!C [K6292#4.Plf]
!Source: guns2j-20090906
